        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST ONE BEDROOM / ONE BATHROOM APARTMENT, PORTOBELLO, DUBLIN 08. LOCATION AVAILABLE NOW \nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this one-bedroom / one bathroom property to the rental market in portobello, Dublin. This well-presented property offers comfortable and modern living in a peaceful and well-established residential setting. Ideally located, it is within easy reach of a range of local amenities, including shops, a GP, schools, cafés, restaurants and excellent public transport links.\nThe property also benefits from excellent public transport links, with bus stops just moments from the development and multiple routes providing easy access to Dublin city centre and beyond. Internal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, spacious double bedroom, bathroom, spacious Living Room & open space kitchen. Available now and viewing is highly advised.\nFeatures: \n•Private parking\n•Top-floor apartment\n•1 bedroom\n•1 bathroom\n•Bright and private feel\n•Highly desirable Portobello location\n•Close to the Grand Canal\n•Excellent cafés, restaurants and pubs nearby\n•Easy access to Dublin city centre\n•Surrounded by parks, culture and local amenities\n•Dublin Bus ( F1,F2,F3, 16, 68A & 122)\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
